  "goodToKnow": "Die Astrologie is astrology, the belief that the stars influence human affairs; it's not a science. Don't confuse it with die Astronomie (astronomy). Common words: das Sternzeichen (star sign), das Horoskop, der Aszendent (ascendant). Asking Was bist du für ein Sternzeichen? is a common small-talk question. Johannes Kepler cast horoscopes for a living alongside his astronomy. It has no plural."
